      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>In the name of God, the merficul, the compassionate</li>\n<li>A valid receipt has been issued for Dal\u012bl b. Mazhar the Jew for ground-rent</li>\n<li>on half the compound that is in the Great Bazaar</li>\n<li>for the year 506 (560?).</li>\n<li>In cash: 4&frac12; (d\u012bn\u0101rs).</li>\n<li>Written by Ab\u016b l-Majd b. \u02bfAl\u012b.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>",
